intro: >-
  Story is one of the hardest parts of game development to manage. Characters,
  locations, dialogue, music, lore, and branching plots end up scattered across
  documents and tools. The challenge wasn't only organising creative
  information, but building a system that helps teams shape, connect, and evolve
  their stories.
