My role focused on the UI, workflows, and feature set. With several systems working together, from asset libraries to branching storyline logic, the interface needed to reduce friction, make relationships obvious, and let people move naturally between ideation, organisation, and building the narrative.

The result was a more polished, cohesive product that supports the way game developers build story-rich worlds, from early brainstorming through to structured story development.
